    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1482">

                <pb facs="0962" n="846" xml:id="pg846"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.41/104.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 21, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I to-day requested Villa to order Benton’s body delivered to wife. Have no answer
                    yet. I omitted mention to-day’s telegram that I have known both Banda and Farias
                    several years, their testimony deserves credence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">G. C. Carothers</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
